WEBVTT

00:07:59.076 --> 00:08:00.676
In Homer's "Odyssey,"

00:08:00.716 --> 00:08:02.596
it was homesickness,

00:08:02.636 --> 00:08:04.516
it was the longing for home

00:08:04.556 --> 00:08:09.116
that caused Odysseus to take
that epic journey in the first place.

00:08:09.116 --> 00:08:12.356
The poem starts with him
weeping on a beach.

00:08:12.356 --> 00:08:14.796
And in most every children's book
you've ever loved,

00:08:14.836 --> 00:08:16.596
the hero is an orphan first.

00:08:16.636 --> 00:08:17.876
Think of Harry Potter --

00:08:17.916 --> 00:08:20.756
broken before the story even starts.

00:08:21.796 --> 00:08:24.196
Longing is also
the beating heart, of course,

00:08:24.196 --> 00:08:26.276
of most of the world's religions.

00:08:26.276 --> 00:08:28.956
We long for Eden and Zion,

00:08:28.996 --> 00:08:30.636
and we long for the Beloved,